<h2><strong><br>Dataflow Architecture</strong></h2>
<p>At the heart of the SN50 is the <a href="/products/dataflow-architecture" rel="noopener">Dataflow Architecture</a>, which enables high performance and high efficiency.</p>
<p><img src="https://sambanova.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png?width=574&amp;height=323&amp;name=REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png" width="574" height="323" loading="lazy" alt="REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new" style="height: auto; max-width: 100%; width: 574px; float: left; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 10px;" srcset="https://sambanova.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png?width=287&amp;height=162&amp;name=REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png 287w, https://sambanova.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png?width=574&amp;height=323&amp;name=REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png 574w, https://sambanova.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png?width=861&amp;height=485&amp;name=REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png 861w, https://sambanova.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png?width=1148&amp;height=646&amp;name=REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png 1148w, https://sambanova.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png?width=1435&amp;height=808&amp;name=REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png 1435w, https://sambanova.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png?width=1722&amp;height=969&amp;name=REBRAND_SambaNova_DataFlow_new.png 1722w" sizes="(max-width: 574px) 100vw, 574px"></p>
<p>While GPUs are good at AI model training, a compute heavy function; AI inference is data movement and memory optimization challenge that requires a different architectural approach.</p>
<p>To perform AI inference GPUs must make multiple, redundant calls to off-chip memory. Each memory call adds latency to the process and consumes energy, which is why GPUs demand so much power.</p>
<p>Alternatively, RDUs map the graph of a given AI model to the most efficient path for moving data across the processor. This approach eliminates redundant calls to memory, which drastically reduces latency and power consumption.</p>
<h2><strong>The Future is Agentic and Needs Dataflow</strong></h2>
<p>As the industry adopts more and more agents, we will need a better full-stack architecture – from chips to models – to better serve these agents. The SN50 RDU is built for this future and will start shipping to customers in the second half of 2026. Excited to learn more about the SN50 RDU, the SambaRack SN50, and Dataflow? <a href="/contact" rel="noopener">Connect</a> with our team of experts!</p>
<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module">




