  <div class="accordion accordion--light txt--light accordion--first-expanded accordion--toggle">
    <div class="accordion__inner clear">
      
        <h2 class="accordion__group-title " style="margin-bottom: 30px">FAQs</h2>
      
      
      <div class="accordion__items">
        
          <div class="accordion__item accordion__item--expanded">
            <div class="accordion__header">
              <div class="accordion__title-summary">
              <h3 class="accordion__title  accordion__title--default large-text important-text">What is the SN50 RDU?</h3>
                <div class="accordion__summary small-text"></div>
              </div>
              <button class="accordion__chevron ui-icon" aria-label="Expand/collapse What is the SN50 RDU?" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-1">
                <span class="accordion__chevron__down">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.29289 8.29289C4.90237 8.68342 4.90237 9.31658 5.29289 9.70711L11.2929 15.7071C11.6834 16.0976 12.3166 16.0976 12.7071 15.7071L18.7071 9.70711C19.0976 9.31658 19.0976 8.68342 18.7071 8.29289C18.3166 7.90237 17.6834 7.90237 17.2929 8.29289L12 13.5858L6.70711 8.29289C6.31658 7.90237 5.68342 7.90237 5.29289 8.29289Z" fill="currentColor" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="accordion__chevron__up">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.29289 15.7071C4.90237 15.3166 4.90237 14.6834 5.29289 14.2929L11.2929 8.29289C11.6834 7.90237 12.3166 7.90237 12.7071 8.29289L18.7071 14.2929C19.0976 14.6834 19.0976 15.3166 18.7071 15.7071C18.3166 16.0976 17.6834 16.0976 17.2929 15.7071L12 10.4142L6.70711 15.7071C6.31658 16.0976 5.68342 16.0976 5.29289 15.7071Z" fill="currentColor" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div id="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-1" role="region" class="accordion__details"><p>The SN50 RDU (Reconfigurable Dataflow Unit) is SambaNova’s fifth-generation AI inference processor designed specifically for large-scale and agentic workloads. It uses its unique Dataflow technology and three-tiered memory architecture to reduce data movement, enabling faster inference, lower latency, and improved energy efficiency compared to traditional accelerator designs.</p></div>
          </div>
        
          <div class="accordion__item">
            <div class="accordion__header">
              <div class="accordion__title-summary">
              <h3 class="accordion__title  accordion__title--default large-text important-text">What is agentic inference?</h3>
                <div class="accordion__summary small-text"></div>
              </div>
              <button class="accordion__chevron ui-icon" aria-label="Expand/collapse What is agentic inference?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-2">
                <span class="accordion__chevron__down">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.29289 8.29289C4.90237 8.68342 4.90237 9.31658 5.29289 9.70711L11.2929 15.7071C11.6834 16.0976 12.3166 16.0976 12.7071 15.7071L18.7071 9.70711C19.0976 9.31658 19.0976 8.68342 18.7071 8.29289C18.3166 7.90237 17.6834 7.90237 17.2929 8.29289L12 13.5858L6.70711 8.29289C6.31658 7.90237 5.68342 7.90237 5.29289 8.29289Z" fill="currentColor" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="accordion__chevron__up">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.29289 15.7071C4.90237 15.3166 4.90237 14.6834 5.29289 14.2929L11.2929 8.29289C11.6834 7.90237 12.3166 7.90237 12.7071 8.29289L18.7071 14.2929C19.0976 14.6834 19.0976 15.3166 18.7071 15.7071C18.3166 16.0976 17.6834 16.0976 17.2929 15.7071L12 10.4142L6.70711 15.7071C6.31658 16.0976 5.68342 16.0976 5.29289 15.7071Z" fill="currentColor" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div id="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-2" role="region" class="accordion__details"><p>Agentic inference refers to AI workloads where autonomous agents perform tasks by breaking problems into multiple steps and making chains of model calls. These workflows require low latency, fast model switching, and efficient memory usage to deliver near-real-time responses.</p></div>
          </div>
        
          <div class="accordion__item">
            <div class="accordion__header">
              <div class="accordion__title-summary">
              <h3 class="accordion__title  accordion__title--default large-text important-text">Why do agents require different infrastructure than traditional AI workloads?</h3>
                <div class="accordion__summary small-text"></div>
              </div>
              <button class="accordion__chevron ui-icon" aria-label="Expand/collapse Why do agents require different infrastructure than traditional AI workloads?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-3">
                <span class="accordion__chevron__down">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.29289 8.29289C4.90237 8.68342 4.90237 9.31658 5.29289 9.70711L11.2929 15.7071C11.6834 16.0976 12.3166 16.0976 12.7071 15.7071L18.7071 9.70711C19.0976 9.31658 19.0976 8.68342 18.7071 8.29289C18.3166 7.90237 17.6834 7.90237 17.2929 8.29289L12 13.5858L6.70711 8.29289C6.31658 7.90237 5.68342 7.90237 5.29289 8.29289Z" fill="currentColor" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="accordion__chevron__up">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.29289 15.7071C4.90237 15.3166 4.90237 14.6834 5.29289 14.2929L11.2929 8.29289C11.6834 7.90237 12.3166 7.90237 12.7071 8.29289L18.7071 14.2929C19.0976 14.6834 19.0976 15.3166 18.7071 15.7071C18.3166 16.0976 17.6834 16.0976 17.2929 15.7071L12 10.4142L6.70711 15.7071C6.31658 16.0976 5.68342 16.0976 5.29289 15.7071Z" fill="currentColor" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div id="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-3" role="region" class="accordion__details"><p>Agentic systems generate frequent, sequential model calls and often switch between models. GPUs are unable to deliver the inference speeds necessary with the necessary level of system throughput to make them cost effective for inference service providers. Infrastructure optimized for inference can reduce these bottlenecks.</p></div>
          </div>
        
          <div class="accordion__item">
            <div class="accordion__header">
              <div class="accordion__title-summary">
              <h3 class="accordion__title  accordion__title--default large-text important-text">How is the SN50 different from GPUs?</h3>
                <div class="accordion__summary small-text"></div>
              </div>
              <button class="accordion__chevron ui-icon" aria-label="Expand/collapse How is the SN50 different from GPUs?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-4">
                <span class="accordion__chevron__down">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.29289 8.29289C4.90237 8.68342 4.90237 9.31658 5.29289 9.70711L11.2929 15.7071C11.6834 16.0976 12.3166 16.0976 12.7071 15.7071L18.7071 9.70711C19.0976 9.31658 19.0976 8.68342 18.7071 8.29289C18.3166 7.90237 17.6834 7.90237 17.2929 8.29289L12 13.5858L6.70711 8.29289C6.31658 7.90237 5.68342 7.90237 5.29289 8.29289Z" fill="currentColor" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="accordion__chevron__up">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.29289 15.7071C4.90237 15.3166 4.90237 14.6834 5.29289 14.2929L11.2929 8.29289C11.6834 7.90237 12.3166 7.90237 12.7071 8.29289L18.7071 14.2929C19.0976 14.6834 19.0976 15.3166 18.7071 15.7071C18.3166 16.0976 17.6834 16.0976 17.2929 15.7071L12 10.4142L6.70711 15.7071C6.31658 16.0976 5.68342 16.0976 5.29289 15.7071Z" fill="currentColor" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div id="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-4" role="region" class="accordion__details"><p>GPUs are general-purpose accelerators designed to handle a wide range of compute workloads, including training. The SN50 RDU is purpose-built for inference and uses Dataflow technology and three-tiered memory architecture that maps model execution directly onto the processor, reducing redundant memory access and improving efficiency for inference workloads.</p></div>
          </div>
        
          <div class="accordion__item">
            <div class="accordion__header">
              <div class="accordion__title-summary">
              <h3 class="accordion__title  accordion__title--default large-text important-text">What types of workloads is the SN50 designed for?</h3>
                <div class="accordion__summary small-text"></div>
              </div>
              <button class="accordion__chevron ui-icon" aria-label="Expand/collapse What types of workloads is the SN50 designed for?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-5">
                <span class="accordion__chevron__down">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.29289 8.29289C4.90237 8.68342 4.90237 9.31658 5.29289 9.70711L11.2929 15.7071C11.6834 16.0976 12.3166 16.0976 12.7071 15.7071L18.7071 9.70711C19.0976 9.31658 19.0976 8.68342 18.7071 8.29289C18.3166 7.90237 17.6834 7.90237 17.2929 8.29289L12 13.5858L6.70711 8.29289C6.31658 7.90237 5.68342 7.90237 5.29289 8.29289Z" fill="currentColor" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="accordion__chevron__up">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.29289 15.7071C4.90237 15.3166 4.90237 14.6834 5.29289 14.2929L11.2929 8.29289C11.6834 7.90237 12.3166 7.90237 12.7071 8.29289L18.7071 14.2929C19.0976 14.6834 19.0976 15.3166 18.7071 15.7071C18.3166 16.0976 17.6834 16.0976 17.2929 15.7071L12 10.4142L6.70711 15.7071C6.31658 16.0976 5.68342 16.0976 5.29289 15.7071Z" fill="currentColor" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div id="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-5" role="region" class="accordion__details"><p>The SN50 is designed for inference-heavy workloads such as AI agents, coding assistants, enterprise copilots, model hosting platforms, and large-scale inference services that require high throughput, low latency, and predictable cost per token.</p></div>
          </div>
        
          <div class="accordion__item">
            <div class="accordion__header">
              <div class="accordion__title-summary">
              <h3 class="accordion__title  accordion__title--default large-text important-text">How does the SN50 impact token economics?</h3>
                <div class="accordion__summary small-text"></div>
              </div>
              <button class="accordion__chevron ui-icon" aria-label="Expand/collapse How does the SN50 impact token economics?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-6">
                <span class="accordion__chevron__down">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
