            <div id="accordion-panel-0d46c990-ec9e-4953-bf06-2a5db398970d-6" role="region" class="accordion__details"><p>By improving latency, throughput, and energy efficiency simultaneously, the SN50 can reduce the cost per generated token and improve infrastructure utilization. This helps organizations scale inference workloads more predictably for these agentic workloads.</p></div>
